{"meta":{"id":"tt32386654","type":"movie","name":"El Mago Del Kremlin","imdb_id":"tt32386654","description":"En medio del caos postsoviético de los años 90, el joven Vadim Baranov (Paul Dano) empieza a labrarse un camino como artista y productor de televisión. Su elocuencia y conexión con las altas esferas le llevan a convertirse, de la noche a la mañana, en el asesor de un agente del KGB con un brillante porvenir: Vladimir Putin (Jude Law). Desde las entrañas del poder, ambos darán forma a la nueva Rusia, difuminando los límites entre la verdad y la mentira.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt32386654.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bDBVzSp24aesVWJBBmWxDcoOSRw.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kV2ob5iXRTKYgW8ByJd1XGElWFw.png","genres":["Drama"],"releaseInfo":"2026","released":"2026-01-21T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"136 min","imdbRating":"6.1","country":"France, United Kingdom, United States of America","cast":["Paul Dano","Jude Law","Alicia Vikander","Tom Sturridge","Will Keen","Jeffrey Wright","Andrei Zayats","Kaspars Kambala","Andris Keišs","George Sogis","Magne-Håvard Brekke","Emmanuel Carrère","Elisa Lasowski","Marija Linarte","Dmitry Krupnikov","Dmitry Turchaninov","Ints Indriksons","Egons Dombrovskis","Vadim Nikolaychuk","Kaspars Kārkliņš","Clément Gyselinck","Rūdolfs Rācenājs","Santa Breikša","Sandis Runge","Sasha Komarova","Evisa Petrovska","Dārta Daneviča","Anta Aizupe","Mārcis Lācis","Ivars Auziņš"],"director":["Olivier Assayas"],"writer":["Olivier Assayas","Giuliano da Empoli","Emmanuel Carrère"],"trailers":[{"source":"rWsuZ5HIARo","type":"Trailer","name":"EL MAGO DEL KREMLIN | TRAILER","ytId":"rWsuZ5HIARo","lang":"es"},{"source":"HloXWUAr9uw","type":"Trailer","name":"Tráiler oficial","ytId":"HloXWUAr9uw","lang":"es"},{"source":"U7ctYp3zQVA","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer","ytId":"U7ctYp3zQVA","lang":"en"},{"source":"7FreRjptHnU","type":"T